This repository only contains CI scripts that build unmodified source from
https://github.com/hrydgard/ppsspp

PPSSPP is Copyright (c) Henrik Rydgård and contributors, licensed under
GPL-2.0-or-later. Corresponding source for each APK is the git commit named
in that GitHub Release.

These APKs are unofficial. They are signed with PPSSPP's in-tree debug
keystore, not the official PPSSPP / Play Store / buildbot key. Android will
not update an official install with these builds (or the reverse) without
uninstalling first.
